1
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:28,016
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:31,043
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:33,936
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:37,529
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,129 --> 00:00:40,083
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,256 --> 00:00:43,056
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,963
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:49,209
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:56,200
Mr. Wang.

10
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:00,679
What brings you here?

11
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,439
We were waiting for you.

12
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:03,560
I know

13
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,480
all your mother's hospital bills

14
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:07,040
were paid by Lu Qiuliang.

15
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,159
You think that's his favor,

16
00:01:09,359 --> 00:01:11,120
your reward for serving him,

17
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,439
right?

18
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:19,799
Listen to this.

19
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,319
(Bingkun.)

20
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,760
(My body should've given out long ago.)

21
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,640
(The meds they're giving me
make me suffer.)

22
00:01:27,239 --> 00:01:29,840
(It feels like needles
in my bones every day.)

23
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:32,439
(I don't want to live
like this anymore.)

24
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,560
Lu Qiuliang just wants
your mother alive.

25
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:37,000
He doesn't care how she lives.

26
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:38,879
As long as she's still breathing,

27
00:01:38,879 --> 00:01:40,280
you'll stay loyal to him.

28
00:01:40,599 --> 00:01:41,680
We've found out

29
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,319
that before my dad's crash,

30
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:44,760
you serviced his car.

31
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,560
Anything to say?

32
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,879
I did service your father's car.

33
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:56,359
But that proves nothing.

34
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:58,680
Then why did you join the Lu family?

35
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,959
My mother was seriously ill.

36
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,239
I needed

37
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:03,319
a higher salary.

38
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:05,200
Lu Qiuliang has used
the cruelest methods

39
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,799
to control and torment you both.

40
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,759
And you still cover for him?

41
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,800
Mr. Lu saved my mother's life

42
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,439
and gave me a chance.

43
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:16,719
I owe him.

44
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,080
Forget it.

45
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:26,159
He's willing to live in a cage

46
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:28,280
and call it a golden nest.

47
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,960
There's no point talking.

48
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:33,599
Let's go.

49
00:02:38,063 --> 00:02:38,548
=Quite The Girl=

50
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,058
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

51
00:02:39,070 --> 00:02:39,578
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

52
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:41,016
=Episode 29=

53
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,759
If the butler keeps his mouth shut,

54
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,240
we can't convict Lu Qiuliang
of instigating murder.

55
00:02:46,599 --> 00:02:47,960
He got away with it last time.

56
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:50,159
Could it happen again?

57
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,439
We've planted a thorn
in the butler's mind.

58
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:53,680
It'll take root on its own

59
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,039
and keep eating away at him.

60
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,280
Dawn will come.

61
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,800
Don't dwell on it tonight.

62
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,800
Get some sleep.

63
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,560
Wang.

64
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:26,280
You've worked hard for me
all these years.

65
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,960
But Duan Xiuming is after you now.

66
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,960
You can't stay in Xizi City anymore.

67
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,520
The money on this card

68
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:38,439
will last you the rest of your life.

69
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,319
Mr. Lu...

70
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:46,400
What about my mother?

71
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,840
Don't worry about her.

72
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:48,800
I've found

73
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,280
the best treatment for her.

74
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,960
Once you're settled abroad,

75
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,879
I'll send her over on a private plane.

76
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,319
I'll arrange the best medical care
for her there.

77
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,759
As for what Mingyu told you,

78
00:04:01,039 --> 00:04:01,919
don't give it another thought.

79
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,800
Those are standard medical procedures.

80
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,439
Your mother has never

81
00:04:05,439 --> 00:04:07,240
suffered at all, not once.

82
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,400
Mr. Lu,

83
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:15,360
thanks for all your care over the years.

84
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,480
After I leave,

85
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,160
please take good care of yourself.

86
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:21,879
You too.

87
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,639
Mr. Lu?

88
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,399
Didn't you tell me to leave?

89
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:21,319
What...

90
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:23,120
What do you mean?

91
00:05:23,279 --> 00:05:24,639
Rather than send you abroad,

92
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,560
I'd rather send you to your grave.

93
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:29,560
Dead men don't spill secrets, after all.

94
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,480
Sorry, Wang.

95
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,560
What...?

96
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:35,879
Do it. Make it clean.

97
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,399
What?

98
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:43,839
Can't you guys understand me?

99
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,920
Do it.

100
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:48,519
Why are you grabbing me?

101
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,480
What are you doing?

102
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:01,839
Duan Xiuming?

103
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:21,040
Now you see what Lu Qiuliang really is?

104
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,800
He didn't want you to leave.

105
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,480
He wanted you dead.

106
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:29,399
I even honored our bond.

107
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:32,079
I'll talk. I'll tell you everything.

108
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,279
It was Lu Qiuliang.

109
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,560
He ordered it!

110
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:35,959
He told me to tamper

111
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:37,240
with the brakes and the airbags.

112
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,160
I have proof!

113
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:40,079
All right, all of you...

114
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:41,360
Lu Mingyu.

115
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:42,959
You think you've won?

116
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,480
You're just like your mother.

117
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,000
You'll both always be mine!

118
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:47,839
Even if I die here today,

119
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:49,319
I'll haunt you from beyond the grave!

120
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,279
This one's for her mother.

121
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,120
This one's for her father.

122
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,199
And this one...

123
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:06,120
is for every second of her suffering.

124
00:07:08,603 --> 00:07:11,229
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

125
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,040
I'll leave the rest to you.

126
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:25,480
Mingyu...

127
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,879
No...

128
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,839
Don't kill me.

129
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:33,319
I'm your uncle.

130
00:07:33,319 --> 00:07:34,800
Spare my life.

131
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:46,920
Killing you would dirty my hands.

132
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,639
You've done too much evil.

133
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,720
The law will punish you.

134
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:59,763
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

135
00:07:59,869 --> 00:08:03,109
♪My own salvation I believe♪

136
00:08:03,323 --> 00:08:05,743
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

137
00:08:06,049 --> 00:08:09,276
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

138
00:08:09,636 --> 00:08:12,056
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

139
00:08:12,263 --> 00:08:15,423
♪My own salvation I believe♪

140
00:08:15,770 --> 00:08:18,243
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

141
00:08:18,570 --> 00:08:20,103
♪I'm the queen♪

142
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,240
(Breaking News.)

143
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,839
(Lu Qiuliang, former Lu Group head,)

144
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:31,079
(was tied to a murder case.)

145
00:08:31,279 --> 00:08:32,759
(Following a police investigation,)

146
00:08:32,759 --> 00:08:34,759
(prosecutors formally filed charges.)

147
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:37,200
(Today, the court delivered
its verdict.)

148
00:08:37,639 --> 00:08:38,399
(After reviewing the case,)

149
00:08:38,399 --> 00:08:40,120
(the court found him guilty)

150
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,840
(and sentenced him accordingly.)

151
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,480
(We will continue to follow)

152
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,960
(the enforcement of this ruling)

153
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,600
(and bring you further updates.)

154
00:08:56,490 --> 00:09:00,950
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

155
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:04,240
Xiuming!

156
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,559
Xiuming, wait up!

157
00:09:05,639 --> 00:09:06,120
Xiuming!

158
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,120
Finally caught up with you.

159
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,240
Here's the thing.

160
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:13,200
You still haven't signed
these documents.

161
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,639
The company needs them urgently.

162
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:16,440
I have to submit them
before the end of the day.

163
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:17,440
Turn around.

164
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:18,600
Go find my brother, not me.

165
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,679
No! Wait!

166
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:21,440
Here's the thing.

167
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,879
I can't explain myself
if you don't sign.

168
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,679
I've already talked to my brother.

169
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:27,240
My brother and I take turns
running Dongchen.

170
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,279
It's his turn this year.

171
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,919
Besides, I'll be accompanying my wife

172
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:32,080
at the Royal Imperial Academy of Arts.

173
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:38,159
Got it.

174
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,600
Well then, Mingyu,

175
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:41,200
I wish you all the best
with your studies.

176
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,840
Guess I'll go bother
your brother instead.

177
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:46,000
Come back here!

178
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:46,879
What?

179
00:09:47,399 --> 00:09:49,279
Aren't you going to wish me anything?

180
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,480
What else do you want?

181
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,879
You've got everything you wanted.

182
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,639
True enough. See ya.

183
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:00,519
Get lost.

184
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:02,879
Get lost.

185
00:10:05,283 --> 00:10:09,396
♪Gemini's joy, a little magic for you♪

186
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,679
You hired me at Dongchen back then

187
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,879
on purpose, didn't you?

188
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,720
You already know the answer.

189
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,840
No one else could've gotten
that position.

190
00:10:20,159 --> 00:10:22,639
You really went to a lot of trouble.

191
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,240
What can I say?

192
00:10:24,519 --> 00:10:26,720
Winning back an ex takes some strategy.

193
00:10:27,279 --> 00:10:28,120
Besides,

194
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,960
my ex is no ordinary woman.

195
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,440
She's Lu Mingye.

196
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:34,559
Congrats on winning your wife back.

197
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:40,879
I have a question for you, too.

198
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,559
When did you

199
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:46,600
fall in love with me?

200
00:10:48,876 --> 00:10:55,856
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

201
00:10:56,370 --> 00:10:58,896
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

202
00:10:59,039 --> 00:10:59,960
(Want to sleep together?)

203
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,279
Want to sleep together?

204
00:11:03,016 --> 00:11:10,003
♪Gemini's joy, a little magic for you♪

205
00:11:10,570 --> 00:11:15,470
♪Close your eyes and count♪

206
00:11:16,656 --> 00:11:23,400
=Quite The Girl=
(The End)

207
00:11:40,963 --> 00:11:45,556
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

208
00:11:48,143 --> 00:11:52,096
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

209
00:11:55,123 --> 00:11:59,603
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

210
00:12:00,936 --> 00:12:05,783
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

211
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:14,823
♪A love letter written in song♪

212
00:12:15,123 --> 00:12:20,083
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

213
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:28,586
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

214
00:12:29,112 --> 00:12:35,078
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

215
00:12:35,641 --> 00:12:42,637
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

216
00:12:43,397 --> 00:12:45,556
♪Close your eyes and count♪

217
00:12:45,847 --> 00:12:48,473
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

218
00:12:48,473 --> 00:12:54,958
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
